cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. Please also cite Evo 2 and any benchmark data you use (see the README)."
title: "evo-vscore"
type: software
abstract: "Command-line tool that scores SNVs and indels from a VCF file with a DNA language model (Evo 2 through NVIDIA's hosted API) and reports the results as CSV and HTML. Includes validation against BRCA1 saturation-genome-editing data and ClinVar indels. Research use only."
authors:
  - alias: "Farhan89082"
version: 0.2.2
date-released: 2026-10-22
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Farhan89082/evo-vscore"
keywords:
  - genomics
  - variant effect prediction
  - DNA language model
  - Evo 2
